{{!-- One book, in Foundry's own bundled pdf.js viewer.

     Deliberately nothing but the frame. The viewer inside it brings its own toolbar, sidebar
     (chapters and thumbnails) and find bar, and a second row of our controls above it would be
     a second place to look for the same three things. What this window adds instead lives in
     its header, where a window's own controls belong. --}}
<div class="stonetop-book-reader">
	<iframe class="stonetop-book-reader-frame" src="{{src}}" title="{{frameTitle}}"></iframe>
</div>
